  "query_preview": "/Sunday through Thursday/...\nIssued 200 PM MST THU NOV 26 2026\nProgressive pattern will continue across the north Pacific into\nthe northwestern US, maintaining mild and relatively moist \nconditions through the period. Several Pacific storms are \nforecast to move inland, with the first one leaving our area \nMonday, the next one Tuesday night/Wednesday passing to our \nsouth but close enough to affect our southern zones, then a \nthird one into all zones late Thursday. We see no sign of \nnortherly flow aloft that could bring cold air into our area, \nbut rather a continuation of westerly flow, keeping temperatures\naround 10 degrees above normal.",
